(zero-wind)
*title Wind metamorphic case
*atmos standard
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0

*trajectory 1 aircraft start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=10000 long=0 lat=0 vel=300 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 mass=10
  *file wind.dat time vel vair mach
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time=5 stop
*end
